<title>FINLAND: TT Tieto 1996 profit doubles.</title>
<headline>TT Tieto 1996 profit doubles.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax   194.3 vs 96.0</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  13.88 vs 11.44</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    5.60 vs 3.90</p>
<p> Net sales					2,054.9 vs 1,148.7</p>
<p> Operating profit				 177.1 vs 85.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish data services group TT Tieto Oy had been for a 183 million markka profit.  </p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation     315.8 vs 165.6</p>
<p> Net profit					 121.7 vs 73.6</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    61.3 vs 47.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish information technology group is TT Tieto Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 6805 0235</p>
</text>
